#. de: Ausgabe[p] von „Abenteuergeschichten: Reise eines Gehilfen I“
#. fr: exemplaire des “Contes d'aventures<nbsp>: Carrière d'un servant I”
#. column 2: copies of <i>Tales of Adventure: One Retainer's Journey I</i>
#. column 8: A detailed record of one retainer's path to becoming a highly sought-after servitor─so detailed, in fact, that all who read it come to swear they experienced the events firsthand.<br><br>Hand over to instantly raise the level of a retainer up to a maximum of 60. (Retainer level cannot exceed current character level in the relevant class/job.)
