#. ja: ロックボックス
#. de: Schließkassette
#. fr: coffre verrouillé
#. column 2: lockboxes
#. column 8: Oft employed by sky pirates and other unsavory individuals to protect their hard-earned plunder, these small containers are nigh impossible to open by all but the most skilled lockpicks.
#. column 9: Lockbox
msgctxt "Item:17341:0:0"
msgid "lockbox"
msgstr "Запертый ларец"

#. de: Schließkassetten
#. fr: coffres verrouillés
#. column 0: lockbox
#. column 8: Oft employed by sky pirates and other unsavory individuals to protect their hard-earned plunder, these small containers are nigh impossible to open by all but the most skilled lockpicks.
#. column 9: Lockbox
msgctxt "Item:17341:0:2"
msgid "lockboxes"
msgstr "Запертые ларцы"

#. ja: 空賊が隠したものと思しき施錠された箱。ロックピッカーに渡すと解錠し、中身のアイテムを鑑定できる
#. de: Der von Luftpiraten und anderen zwielichtigen Gestalten bevorzugte Aufbewahrungsort für ihre hart erarbeitete Beute. Lässt sich nur von den erfahrensten Schlüsselmeisterinnen öffnen.
#. fr: Ce coffre semble contenir le butin de pirates des cieux. Une personne experte en crochetage saurait l'ouvrir.
#. column 0: lockbox
#. column 2: lockboxes
#. column 9: Lockbox
msgctxt "Item:17341:0:8"
msgid "Oft employed by sky pirates and other unsavory individuals to protect their hard-earned plunder, these small containers are nigh impossible to open by all but the most skilled lockpicks."
msgstr "Эти небольшие ларцы часто используют небесные пираты и прочие тёмные личности, чтобы хранить награбленное. Открыть их под силу лишь самым искусным взломщикам замков."

#. ja: ロックボックス
#. de: Schließkassette
#. fr: Coffre verrouillé
#. column 0: lockbox
#. column 2: lockboxes
#. column 8: Oft employed by sky pirates and other unsavory individuals to protect their hard-earned plunder, these small containers are nigh impossible to open by all but the most skilled lockpicks.
msgctxt "Item:17341:0:9"
msgid "Lockbox"
msgstr "Запертый ларец"

#. ja: 潰れたロックボックス
#. de: beschädigt[a] Schließkassette
#. fr: coffre verrouillé abîmé
#. column 2: damaged lockboxes
#. column 8: This lockbox is so badly damaged that the chances whatever lies within remains undamaged are slim. Most lockpicks (who oft claim as part of their fee a certain portion of a box's contents) will not even attempt to open one. Bring them several, however, and they may be more amenable to the task.
#. column 9: Damaged Lockbox
msgctxt "Item:17342:0:0"
msgid "damaged lockbox"
msgstr "Повреждённый запертый ларец"

#. de: beschädigt[a] Schließkassetten
#. fr: coffres verrouillés abîmés
#. column 0: damaged lockbox
#. column 8: This lockbox is so badly damaged that the chances whatever lies within remains undamaged are slim. Most lockpicks (who oft claim as part of their fee a certain portion of a box's contents) will not even attempt to open one. Bring them several, however, and they may be more amenable to the task.
#. column 9: Damaged Lockbox
msgctxt "Item:17342:0:2"
msgid "damaged lockboxes"
msgstr "Повреждённые запертые ларцы"

#. ja: 潰れてしまった施錠された箱。一定数集めてロックピッカーに渡すと解錠し、無事だった中身のアイテムを鑑定できる
#. de: Diese Schließkassette ist so schwer beschädigt, dass der Inhalt vermutlich nicht mehr intakt ist. Die meisten Schlüsselmeisterinnen werden sich nicht mit dem Öffnen befassen, solange du ihnen nicht direkt mehrere davon bringst.
#. fr: Ce coffre verrouillé est en piteux état. Rapportez-en plusieurs à une personne experte en crochetage pour découvrir ce qu'il y a à l'intérieur.
#. column 0: damaged lockbox
#. column 2: damaged lockboxes
#. column 9: Damaged Lockbox
msgctxt "Item:17342:0:8"
msgid "This lockbox is so badly damaged that the chances whatever lies within remains undamaged are slim. Most lockpicks (who oft claim as part of their fee a certain portion of a box's contents) will not even attempt to open one. Bring them several, however, and they may be more amenable to the task."
msgstr "Ларец так сильно повреждён, что содержимое, скорее всего, тоже пострадало. Большинство взломщиков замков даже не возьмутся за такое дело — тем более что они часто забирают часть добычи в качестве платы. А вот если принести сразу несколько ларцов, они могут согласиться."

