#. ja: 稀少マハ古銭
#. de: Mhach-Schilling
#. fr: pièce mhachoise précieuse
#. column 2: Mhachi shillings
#. column 8: A small coin of low denomination once used in the long-fallen nation of Mhach. There are twelve Mhachi pennies in a shilling. Once actively sought by numismatists across Eorzea, the market soon became oversaturated, causing this ancient currency to lose its value entirely.
#. column 9: Mhachi Shilling
msgctxt "Item:17595:0:0"
msgid "Mhachi shilling"
msgstr "Мхачский шиллинг"

#. de: Mhach-Schillinge
#. fr: pièces mhachoises précieuses
#. column 0: Mhachi shilling
