#. de: Diese mysteriöse Substanz kann Materie assimilieren und sämtliche Eigenschaften der kopierten Materie über<shy>nehmen, was sie zu einem perfekten Material für Reparaturen von Aus<shy>rüstungs<shy>gegen<shy>ständen der Stufen 1 bis 80 macht.
#. fr: Un minerai réagissant à l'énergie spirituelle, et qui a des facultés d'assimilation avec d'autres matières. Convient aux équipements de niveau 1 à 80.
#. column 0: fragment of grade 7 dark matter
#. column 2: fragments of grade 7 dark matter
#. column 9: Grade 7 Dark Matter
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Item:17837:0:8"
msgid "It has recently been discovered that this substance of unknown origin has the faculty to assimilate with other forms of matter, effectively restoring them to their original condition. This specific grade of dark matter has been shown to bond best with precisely crafted items made from high-quality materials.<br><br>[Used to repair equipment for levels 1-80.]"
msgstr "Недавно выяснилось, что это вещество неизвестного происхождения способно сливаться с другими веществами и возвращать их в исходное состояние. Тёмная материя VII грейда лучше всего подходит для ремонта искусно изготовленных предметов из высококачественных материалов.<br><br>[Используется для ремонта снаряжения 1–80-го уровней.]"

#. ja: ダークマターG7
#. de: Grad 7 Dunkelmaterie
#. fr: Matière sombre grade VII
#. column 0: fragment of grade 7 dark matter
#. column 2: fragments of grade 7 dark matter
#. column 8: It has recently been discovered that this substance of unknown origin has the faculty to assimilate with other forms of matter, effectively restoring them to their original condition. This specific grade of dark matter has been shown to bond best with precisely crafted items made from high-quality materials.<br><br>[Used to repair equipment for levels 1-80.]
msgctxt "Item:17837:0:9"
msgid "Grade 7 Dark Matter"
msgstr "Тёмная материя VII грейда"

